# Hosts that always open in your usual browser, not in the Armory split.
# Empty by default: every link you click in Ghostty opens in the split.
# Uncomment or add hosts for sites whose logins, passkeys or password
# manager you want to keep in your usual browser. One pattern per line;
# '*.host' matches its subdomains. Copied to ~/.config/armory/link-rules on
# install; edit that copy.

# github.com
# *.github.com
# gitlab.com
# *.gitlab.com
# login.microsoftonline.com
# accounts.google.com
# appleid.apple.com
# *.atlassian.net
